  "playerSeries(docs, from, to, tz): inclusive range, only days with data (absent key = no data, never 0).",
  "sleep/mood/energy/cog/kcal are plan A's dailyInputs values (round2 half-up); readiness = readiness(dailyInputs) for each day with any readiness input.",
